                <li class="ind-help-item"><span class="ind-help-num">02</span><div><h3 class="ind-help-title">Full-stack coverage</h3><p class="ind-help-desc">External surface, cloud, APIs, binaries (.exe, .dmg, .apk) — one platform, one evidence trail.</p></div></li>
